132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Each voxel is treated as a 1D data point whose only feature is its intensity value. The algorithm partitions all voxels into k = 4 clusters by iteratively assigning each voxel to the nearest centroid and updating centroids until convergence, minimizing the total within-cluster variance.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
